  "solution": "**Given**\n\n64x3 + 38x2y + 20xy2 + y3\n\nx = 3 and y = - 4\n\n**Formula used**\n\n(a + b)³ = a³ + b³ + 3ab(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n64x3 + 38x2y + 20xy2 + y³ = (4x + y)³ - 10x²y + 8xy²\n\n⇒ (4x + y)3 - 10x2y + 8xy² = (12 - 4)3 - 10(3)2(- 4) + 8(3)(- 4)2\n\n⇒ 8³ + 360 + 384\n\n⇒ 1256\n\n**The value is 1256.**",
